     <property name="text">
      <string>These options specify the preferred startup sequence and timing for VMs when they are automatically started with a vApp or during an HA operation. VMs with a start order of 0 (zero) will be started first. You can also configure a delay interval which specifies how long after starting the VM to wait before starting up the next group of VMs in the startup sequence.</string>
